  "raw_text": "A tradeoff was identified between stripping control characters before compression versus compressing the raw terminal output directly. Running `col -b` before gzip would produce cleaner, human-readable text but would require an additional pipe stage and lose timing or escape metadata embedded in the raw output. The decision leaned toward compressing raw `script` output, accepting that the stored files would require decompression and interpretation rather than being directly readable.",
